# A phone unplugged between its grant and its prep (#59): acquire exits 76 and gives the fresh
# lease back, so env then finds none.
plug FAKEPHONE01 device usb:1-1 model:Pixel_8
yank FAKEPHONE01
$ a@plain-a devlab acquire --quiet
2> devlab: FAKEPHONE01: adb could not reach it: plug it in and allow USB debugging, then devlab prep
2> devlab: phone FAKEPHONE01 (Pixel 8) is unplugged: run devlab acquire to replace it
? 76
$ a@plain-a devlab env
2> devlab: no lease for <sandbox>/wt/plain-a (claude:<a>): run devlab acquire
? 4
$ a@plain-a devlab status
1> devices: none attached
1> memory <mem> GB free; watcher active
? 0
